TITLE Stoichiometric Albite dissolution (1 mol total) with H2S gas at 200C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Fe(3) 4
    Fe(2) 4

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    -volume 1
    H2S(g) 5

REACTION 1
    Albite 1
    1
    1000*0.01

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -reaction true
    -totals Na Al Si Fe S

END
